\section{Units and conversions}{

Depth is converted from centimetres to metres, PANGAEA's convention for
\verb{Depth, sediment/rock}. Ages are written as years before present on the
1950 CE datum and labelled \verb{[a BP]}. Nothing else is rescaled.
}

